### ==========================================
### GET Requests
### ==========================================

### Get all cars (200 OK)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars

### Get car by ID (200 OK)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars/1

### Get car by non-existent ID (404 Not Found)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars/999


### ==========================================
### POST Requests
### ==========================================

### Create a new car (201 Created)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "make": "Ford",
  "model": "Mustang",
  "year": 2022
}

### Create car - Missing required fields (400 Bad Request)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "make": "Ford"
}

### Create car - Malformed JSON (400 Bad Request, "Invalid JSON")
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{ "make": "Ford",


### ==========================================
### PUT Requests
### ==========================================

### Update existing car (200 OK)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "make": "Tesla",
  "model": "Model 3 Performance",
  "year": 2026
}

### Update car - Missing required fields (400 Bad Request)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "make": "Tesla"
}

### Update car - Non-existent ID (404 Not Found)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "make": "Tesla",
  "model": "Model 3",
  "year": 2024
}


### ==========================================
### DELETE Requests
### ==========================================

### Delete specific car (204 No Content)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars/2

### Delete non-existent car (404 Not Found)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars/999


### ==========================================
### Other Errors
### ==========================================

### Unknown route (404 Not Found, "Not found")
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/unknown
